{"n": 141, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "141.webp", "text": "11.12 100 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nCYLINDER HEAD\n— BMW 324d —\n\nDisconnect hoses (4 and 5)\n\nDisconnect battery ground lead.\n\nDrain coolant in engine block and radiator.\nInstallation:\n\nPour in coolant*** and bleed cooling system,\nsee Group 17.\n\nReplace engine oil ***\n\nUnscrew pipe clamp on transmission. Unscrew exhaust pipes on exhaust manifold.\nInstallation:\n\nCheck gaskets, replacing if necessary\n\nCoat studs with copper paste “CRC\"**\nReplace self-locking nuts.\n\nTightening torque*\n\nRemove hose (6).\nUnscrew clamp (7)\nUnscrew nut (8) and remove air cleaner\n\nRemove fan, see 11 52 000.\nDisconnect hoses,\n\nUnscrew expansion tank and place aside. Disconnect hose (1).\nPull off plug (2).\nPull off leak line (3) and unscrew on injection\n\n* See Specifications\n** Source of Supply: HWB\n\n*** See Service Information of Gr. 00", "words": [["11.12", 0.2675, 0.0723, 0.2938, 0.0836], ["100", 0.2989, 0.0729, 0.3161, 0.0836], ["REMOVING", 0.3293, 0.0723, 0.3891, 0.0836], ["AND", 0.3931, 0.0729, 0.4169, 0.0836], ["INSTALLING", 0.4215, 0.0729, 0.4889, 0.0836], ["CYLINDER", 0.3288, 0.0882, 0.386, 0.0995], ["HEAD", 0.3906, 0.0889, 0.421, 0.0995], ["—", 0.3298, 0.1101, 0.3354, 0.1121], ["BMW", 0.3399, 0.1048, 0.3652, 0.1154], ["324d", 0.3688, 0.1048, 0.3956, 0.1154], ["—", 0.4002, 0.1101, 0.4063, 0.1127], ["Disconnect", 0.7619, 0.0729, 0.8151, 0.0836], ["hoses", 0.8197, 0.0743, 0.845, 0.0836], ["(4", 0.8501, 0.0736, 0.8582, 0.0829], ["and", 0.8622, 0.0743, 0.8789, 0.0836], ["5)", 0.883, 0.0729, 0.8916, 0.0836], ["Disconnect", 0.2665, 0.1366, 0.3197, 0.1472], ["battery", 0.3237, 0.1373, 0.3576, 0.1499], ["ground", 0.3612, 0.1379, 0.3946, 0.1499], ["lead.", 0.3987, 0.1379, 0.42, 0.1472], ["Drain", 0.2665, 0.1525, 0.2928, 0.1631], ["coolant", 0.2964, 0.1532, 0.3323, 0.1638], ["in", 0.3359, 0.1558, 0.3445, 0.1631], ["engine", 0.3475, 0.1552, 0.3784, 0.1658], ["block", 0.382, 0.1532, 0.4078, 0.1638], 